OL,4,BFirst defeat and first red for         
OL,5,BFerguson as Glens falter               
OL,6,GIt was a night of unfortunate firsts   
OL,7,Gfor Duncan Ferguson at Solitude on     
OL,8,GFriday.                                
OL,10,FThe Everton great suffered his first   
OL,11,Fdefeat as Glentoran boss as they were  
OL,12,Fedged out 3-2 by Cliftonville in an    
OL,13,FIrish Premiership thriller.            
OL,15,FHe also received his first red card as 
OL,16,Fa manager, after picking up nine       
OL,17,Fduring his playing career, in the      
OL,18,Ffirst half for protesting the decision 
OL,19,Fto award Cliftonville's first goal     
OL,20,Fafter he perceived a foul in the build-
OL,21,Fup.                                    
